            "review_title": "Review at The Greek Taverna",
            "review_text": "Giannis g\nCrete, Greece3 contributions\n0\nUnforgettable experience\nMar 2026 • Couples\nAmazing location next to the lake! Great atmosphere with low relaxing greek music and very taste plates! We explored the greek cuisine trying the mix dips with handmade pita bread and also the souvlaki! Don't forget the seafood as well with fresh octopus and kalamari. The owners christos and Maria were both amazing and friendly! The staff as well all with a smile and really good English! Don't miss it go and try it the prices are really good as well!!!\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nTry the mix dips for sure!\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten March 10, 2026",
