            "review_title": "Review at The Greek Taverna",
            "review_text": "tubbies74\nPontypool, United Kingdom5606 contributions\n0\nGenuine Greek Welcome\nMay 2025 • Couples\nThis is a totally unassuming small Greek restaurant..\nWhat it lacks in size is more than made up by the owner, who is a true Greek gentleman.. and his wonderful staff ...\n\nThe restaurant has a very friendly, relaxed, and homely feel about it..\nAnd the cusine is honestly authentic Greek..\nYou won't be disappointed if you take the time to dine here..\nIt is located around 15 minutes from the old quarter area of the city, so a grab is needed if you're staying in that area during your visit..\nBut it's worth the journey in my humble opinion...\nRead more\nWritten May 28, 2025",
