            "review_text": "marguerite k\nCork, Ireland13 contributions\n0\nA Gem of a restaurant, fantastic experience\nOct 2024 • Family\nI stayed in Hanoi for 2 weeks and our accommodation was very near this gem of a restaurant. On our first visit, Christophe, the owner, a very charming and charismatic Greek man gave us a very warm welcome. The food is suberb, the meats, breads, dips and vegetables are so fresh and super tasty. He even gave us the most most delicious chocolate and biscuit pots as complimentary desserts which finished off our meal so perfectly. \nOn several occasions we popped in for a glass of vine when passing and the most beautiful herb tomatoes and olives were landed on our table. It’s the small touches that make this restaurant so great. \nI would highly recommended The Greek Taverna, thank you Christophe and team .\nRead more\nWritten October 30, 2024",
